<title>USA: IPO FILING-Meade Instruments Corp.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING-Meade Instruments Corp.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 Meade Instruments Corp</p>
<p>Stock symbol			MEAD.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $8-$10/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    3,370,000</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 2,500,000</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  870,000 Shrs outstanding after ipo    7,500,000</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Morgan Keegan &amp; Co Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  505,500 shrs Business: Irvine, Calif.,-based company is a designer, manufacturer and distributor of telescopes and accessories for the beginning to serious amateur astromer.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: will be used to redeem for about $6.9 million all of the outstanding shares of the company's redeemable preferred stock, to repay about $8.2 million of term indebtedness and for general working capital purposes.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s year ended Feb 28:</p>
<p>				   1996		 1995</p>
<p>   - Revenue		 $29,770	    $24,934</p>
<p>   - Net Income	     $1,556	     $2,051</p>
